Phenomenological Chess Coach - MVP

Four-agent chess system playing on the machine as canon:
- Orchestrator: strategic manifest + continuity + Blunder Protocol
- One-off player: single-move proposer, illegal-move blacklist,
  comprehension-horizon gate (5..15 plies by level)
- Sandbox: decreasing beam-width / decreasing-depth (5->4->3->2->1) calculation
- Evaluator: phenomenological coach keyed to a 200-term glossary
Backends: local llama-server (default) / Gemini / deterministic Stockfish-only.
Web UI + single .bat launcher. Program on C:, data+venv on F:.

